        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Rotkohl takes red cabbage and transforms it into something rich and gently spiced over a slow braise. The sweet-sour balance comes from vinegar and brown sugar. It is one of those dishes that improves significantly with time -- make it the day before if you can." }]
